  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The realization was sudden. If a seal requires portents as fuel, how many least portents would make a lesser portent? The answer, it turns out, is three.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Efficient Seal, Extra Seal, maximum hand size of 4 or higher</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use a seal, you may discard three least portents and treat it as though you discarded a lesser portent. Similarly, you may discard three lesser portents and treat it as though you discarded a greater portent. Using this feat increases the fate point cost of the seal by +1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
